    "detailed_description": "<strong>Find us here: </strong><br>Official QQ Group: 580628484<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/adc1cb50db98cd9946e727988351a2a1.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><strong>Welcome to &quot;Coral Reef Paradise&quot;!</strong><br>Greetings! I'm John Mill, the warden of Coral Reef. I could give you a detailed introduction to the game, but honestly, why not just dive in and experience it yourself? Saves us both some time, and after all, my time is quite valuable.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/7303a42f15b1d0dd14888a42b5da84b7.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/73d7e4c266d5707ccb3abddc357f728b.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>It's strange, isn't it? Despite the abundance of modern society, people like you still end up here. Not that it bothers me. I've heard you're claiming to be innocent, though? Classic. Try as you might, no one gets out of this place without my say-so.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/521b71ccab34deddf5ae11f17fb81408.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/389b4566a6aea0487b84a0942b0e00f9.poster.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/389b4566a6aea0487b84a0942b0e00f9.webm?t=1737105610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/389b4566a6aea0487b84a0942b0e00f9.mp4?t=1737105610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/9d4a99d248c168297636e5bd267cf6c4.poster.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/9d4a99d248c168297636e5bd267cf6c4.webm?t=1737105610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/9d4a99d248c168297636e5bd267cf6c4.mp4?t=1737105610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>So, what\u2019s your approach\u2014words or fists? In Coral Reef Prison, there are two ways to resolve conflicts: through persuasion or... convince them with violence. Choose wisely.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/1dcb56f4a405526a3f22152c9928653c.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/c0e6c019c7ceef13e4786c3707ff60bb.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Even in prison, work needs to be done. Whether it\u2019s mining, reading, martial arts, or working the sewing machine, there\u2019s plenty to keep you busy. I\u2019m a man of my word, so work hard, and you\u2019ll get paid. A prosperous life here isn\u2019t just a fantasy. Develop your skills, and if you\u2019re lucky, you might even stand out in Coral Reef Paradise\u2019s unique \u201creality show.\u201d<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/5524ef067d8fd0e0038ab6c62d595ae4.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/0edd618071b8e3192ea563305f181d9e.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br>Everyone in Coral Reef Prison has a story and a talent. Some might become allies, while others could be a threat. Choose your friends wisely\u2014your decisions will shape your future here. Focus on collaboration for efficiency, and avoid letting your mind wander where it shouldn\u2019t.<br><br>Now, I\u2019ll hand it over to the Vinland Studio team. Frankly, they owe me for this promo, but instead, they paid Steam for the interface. Not the best business strategy, if you ask me...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Vinland Studio</h2><br>Hello, everyone! We want to express our heartfelt thanks for your support of <i>Prison Notes</i>. Vinland Studio is a small team based in Shanghai. <i>Prison Notes</i> is our first collaborative game, and we hope it brings you an enjoyable experience. We sincerely appreciate you playing our game.<br><br>Credits<br>Producer/Scriptwriter/Director/Game Designer/Music: Pigeon Yusha Chugging Vodka<br>Art: Digitizer Man<br>Programmer: GG<br>Game Designer/Publisher: Leo",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Find us here: </strong><br>Official QQ Group: 580628484<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/adc1cb50db98cd9946e727988351a2a1.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><strong>Welcome to &quot;Coral Reef Paradise&quot;!</strong><br>Greetings! I'm John Mill, the warden of Coral Reef. I could give you a detailed introduction to the game, but honestly, why not just dive in and experience it yourself? Saves us both some time, and after all, my time is quite valuable.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/7303a42f15b1d0dd14888a42b5da84b7.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/73d7e4c266d5707ccb3abddc357f728b.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>It's strange, isn't it? Despite the abundance of modern society, people like you still end up here. Not that it bothers me. I've heard you're claiming to be innocent, though? Classic. Try as you might, no one gets out of this place without my say-so.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/521b71ccab34deddf5ae11f17fb81408.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/389b4566a6aea0487b84a0942b0e00f9.poster.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/389b4566a6aea0487b84a0942b0e00f9.webm?t=1737105610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\