0/extras/5524ef067d8fd0e0038ab6c62d595ae4.avif?t=1737105610\" width=573 height=89 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152380/extras/0edd618071b8e3192ea563305f181d9e.avif?t=1737105610\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br>Everyone in Coral Reef Prison has a story and a talent. Some might become allies, while others could be a threat. Choose your friends wisely\u2014your decisions will shape your future here. Focus on collaboration for efficiency, and avoid letting your mind wander where it shouldn\u2019t.<br><br>Now, I\u2019ll hand it over to the Vinland Studio team. Frankly, they owe me for this promo, but instead, they paid Steam for the interface. Not the best business strategy, if you ask me...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Vinland Studio</h2><br>Hello, everyone! We want to express our heartfelt thanks for your support of <i>Prison Notes</i>. Vinland Studio is a small team based in Shanghai. <i>Prison Notes</i> is our first collaborative game, and we hope it brings you an enjoyable experience. We sincerely appreciate you playing our game.<br><br>Credits<br>Producer/Scriptwriter/Director/Game Designer/Music: Pigeon Yusha Chugging Vodka<br>Art: Digitizer Man<br>Programmer: GG<br>Game Designer/Publisher: Leo",
